# Test-only dependencies: what scripts/release/test-image.sh adds to a throwaway container of a
# release image, to run the unit suite against exactly what ships. Compiled into
# test-requirements.lock against requirements.lock as a constraint, so a test tool can never
# pull a shipped package to a different version than the image has.
